       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CANONICAL-COMPLEMENT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COMPLEMENTARITY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-OBSERVATION-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNCERTAINTY-BOUNDS-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DUAL-BASIS-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMPLEMENT-LATENCY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMPLEMENTARITY-SEAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-COMPLEMENT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CMP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CMP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-OBSERVE-AND-BOUNDS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BASIS-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CMP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-OBSERVE-AND-BOUNDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OBSERVATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNCERTAINTY-BOUNDS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BASIS-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-BASIS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPLEMENT-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CMP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-OBSERVATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-UNCERTAINTY-BOUNDS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DUAL-BASIS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COMPLEMENT-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPLEMENTARITY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CMP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CMP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CMP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CMP-CODE.
